      "content": "The thoughts you are having sound incredibly overwhelming, and it is vital that you know you do not have to carry this silence alone. If you are having thoughts of ending your life, please reach out immediately to a crisis hotline. In the US, you can call or text 988 to connect with the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline, anytime. Help is available right now, and there are people who want to support you through this darkness.",
      "source": "target",
